          "id": 3313383684,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Do *either* Ctrl-+ or Ctrl-= zoom in, and does Ctrl-- zoom out, on Windows? I just tried it on my Windows 11 VM with 4.6.5 (v4.6.5-0-gb40c46f83867), and it doesn't seem to do any zooming (unlike Microsoft Edge, which does zoom in and out).",
