          "id": 3313427109,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "They also don't work on Ubuntu 24.04 with a build from the main branch. Kate (Qt-based, being a KDE editor, but using Qt 5) also doesn't support them, but the GNOME text editor (using GTK+) does.\n\nIs there something we need to wire up to make them work on Windows and Un*x+{X11,Wayland}?",
